## Slide 4

Content Parts | Data Table Parts

Designed to execute pre-defined queries on the TrakSYS Database
Return commonly used sets of data as DataTable objects deposited in the Values Dictionary
Contain properties and settings allowing the Developer to manipulate and configure aspects of the query without writing SQL
